d at product level but still marked “未能确认” in v3; no new contradictions introduced; five residuals are deferrable. Verdict PASS_WITH_NOTE.\n\n**Files touched**  \n.I'll write the full T-007 output in the same style as T-006.The deliverable is written. Let me do a quick verification that the file structure is complete.The deliverable is complete. I should give a concise summary to the user/dispatcher as the final response.",
